    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a4515da22480add69257a5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Mar 2026 14:55:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>女性觉醒不是胜利，只是不得不。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容要点</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a> 三个人的《漂亮女人》初体验：感动、生气、「我太讨厌这个剧了」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="898">14:58</a> 老白男想象，和我们的女性主义观点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> 欲望主体vs欲望客体：我们如何看待自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> 讲讲《侏儒妖小矮人》这个童话故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 觉醒一定更好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3201">53:21</a> 母女关系：理解、切割与无法真正分离</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3781">63:01</a> 春节「幸福」时刻：妈妈的自我暴露、写给小鸟的诗、路灯下的告别</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关阅读</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>静竹的播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67ebfe855c72b4b93713bcbb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67ebfe855c72b4b93713bcbb"><span>「就这个啊？」</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>往期母女话题节目：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685d0a01bef90978ec02b442" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685d0a01bef90978ec02b442"><span>从共生到独立：当妈后我反而更自由</span></a><span>；</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64b41117d0844ea812c00626" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64b41117d0844ea812c00626"><span>越聊越不甘心的母女对话</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KncoTAUplTyj1bkjMKilAQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KncoTAUplTyj1bkjMKilAQ"><span>《漂亮女人》：一件穿不进的戏服，和那个我演不出的自己</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiaJjTtSSYm8b6WMQCtfL_4iTLYE.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/1043008/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/1043008/"><span>《格林童话》</span></a><span>（《侏儒妖小矮人》编号为KHM55）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>萨特</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/1023557/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/1023557/"><span>《禁闭》</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292064/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292064/"><span>《楚门的世界》</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>话剧九人</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/location/drama/36929994/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/location/drama/36929994/"><span>《翻山海》</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>本期音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Sarah Hester Ross - Savage Daughter</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>聊天的人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>梦妮</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿青</span></p><span></span><p><span>静竹</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于节目</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>一档又卷又菜又有心的闲聊节目。</span></p>]]></description>
