    <guid isPermaLink="false">6980ea8f073030367adf3e0b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Feb 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>四个在播客公司声动活泼认识的女孩儿从北京出发，分别在纽约、大阪、上海和青岛开启了新生活。二年后，她们在线上重聚，互相分享人生的新变化。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容要点</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 那一天，我们加入了声动活泼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> 对彼此的第一印象：我要保护这个比我更 i 的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1455">24:15</a> 从播客公司毕业，前往五花八门的新目的地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 大家的创作新尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2194">36:34</a> 什么？她结婚了！什么？她离婚了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2828">47:08</a> 能够描述生活的细节，说明你非常充实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3477">57:57</a> 我们的新年祝福</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关阅读</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>佳勋的「叙事播客创作营」</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuHayYzZleU0VlEfCICwN6ISMXWu.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsO42nKmmVgVWLzJPZCVLDA9q0gM.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>佳勋的创作营衍生播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ef23de6f335b2a6f459ef7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ef23de6f335b2a6f459ef7"><span>「故事实验室」</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>陈太太的播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61289ae0e2ca6ba2170b5c03" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61289ae0e2ca6ba2170b5c03"><span>「前后院儿」</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>饭团参与设计的产品</span><a href="https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/grow-%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E8%B4%B4%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%BD%E4%BC%99%E4%BC%B4/id1560604814" data-url="https://apps.apple.com/cn/app/grow-%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E8%B4%B4%E5%BF%83%E5%A5%BD%E4%BC%99%E4%BC%B4/id1560604814"><span>「Grow」</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>本期音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>MAMAMOO - Travel</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>聊天的人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>梦妮</span></p><span></span><p><span>佳勋</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈太太</span></p><span></span><p><span>饭团</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于节目</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>一档又卷又菜又有心的闲聊节目。</span></p>]]></description>
