  <item>
    <title>38 蛇年演蛇｜迷失的小青、漂泊的法海，都怎样寻找自己？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694d244763a654fa60cfc0fb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694d244763a654fa60cfc0fb</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Dec 2025 12:33:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年10月，我们踏上再次前往清迈的旅途，和一群艺术家朋友参与了为期七天的面具与影子戏共创。在这七天同吃同住同睡同创作的旅途中，我们表达、争吵、发呆、拥抱......</span></p><span></span><p><span>最终编创的这部剧叫《七寸之心》，是一个以《白蛇传》为起点衍生而出的故事：迷失的小青、漂泊的法海，都在怎样寻找自己？要找回初心，又会经历怎样的过程？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期播客中，你会听到我们作为体验者和创作者，在一部戏从0到1创作的过程中，那些所思所想所感所惑。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容要点</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="379">06:19</a> 从制作一朵云开始的角色创作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1133">18:53</a> 一次「不再引领，努力跟随」的全新体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1349">22:29</a> 梦妮的面具：一个不明白「爱是什么」的心脏小女孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1648">27:28</a> 阿青的面具：一个伤心的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2012">33:32</a> 在戏剧中寻找自己、满足自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2524">42:04</a> 人会一次次地重新找回自己的初心和热爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2845">47:25</a> 在戏里，作为心脏体会其他人的寻心之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3355">55:55</a> 为关系纵身一跃，给予和获得会同时发生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3589">59:49</a> 保持困惑比得到答案更重要</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在清迈编创的面具影子戏：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk1k-U9jZirOk8p2wROoixxkQDzq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FutS6Nt0YvYWfrVhZbWAJ-ey578V.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsUjXDxfPMPrWJbvtBzAhZU1zW2y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>我们在清迈制作的面具角色：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlijnLqp48Az0VwRvQoi8Z5sEACa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>梦妮的心脏女孩</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FocBJ5_DPwflyRqU4TkXlRHOyET3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>阿青的悲伤白蛇</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关阅读</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67aa2371247d51713cdac003" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67aa2371247d51713cdac003"><span>No.24 在沉默、安全感、爱情的边界候场丨面具戏剧回顾</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>清迈观剧剧场：</span><a href="https://noghosts.my.canva.site/gallery" data-url="https://noghosts.my.canva.site/gallery"><span>part-time theatre</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>阿青的独角戏《漂亮女人》</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftv7G-rjg6aUvBlpDCowGLE7s773.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>克拉拉和大甜的戏剧厂牌</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/9quuQAc7S5W" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/9quuQAc7S5W"><span>女土蝠</span></a><span>（可以在这里找到清迈营的相关信息）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>本期音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>龚琳娜 - 法海你不懂爱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>聊天的人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>梦妮</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿青</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于节目</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>一档又卷又菜又有心的闲聊节目。</span></p>]]></description>
