  <item>
    <title>36 再见爱人5：你闭嘴，我只想做我自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/692ff4633fec3166cf0a0258</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">692ff4633fec3166cf0a0258</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Dec 2025 08:33:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>看完《再见爱人5》第七期，不吐不快的我们又来了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ps. &nbsp;忙碌的年底已经积压了好几期素材，计划十二月狠狠更新，听众们暂且再等待一下~~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容要点</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a> rapper夫妇：房间里的大象是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="657">10:57</a> 人们都在沙漠里向同伴要水喝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="817">13:37</a> 再丰盈的亲密关系，也有图穷匕见的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1027">17:07</a> 要「自我」还是要「关系」？我们的时代最强音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1369">22:49</a> 当我们讨论关系里的大人和小孩、男人和女人，是在说什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2209">36:49</a> 美女与猴子：你说得对，我就会听吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2678">44:38</a> 条件满分的优秀女性，为什么也得不到幸福？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3258">54:18</a> 我们不得不为自己的选择承担代价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3694">61:34</a> 「真实」是绝望中支撑我们的小火苗</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关阅读</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f1eeee456ffec65e3ab8a6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f1eeee456ffec65e3ab8a6"><span>No.35 再见爱人5:「家暴疑云」原来是爆笑的爆</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6610ca0dc891c06e73858941" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6610ca0dc891c06e73858941"><span>No.16 爱自己还是成全爱人？宋代大女主的抉择</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/I1E0AjkRvONU7Ai5-2_f3g" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/I1E0AjkRvONU7Ai5-2_f3g"><span>《漂亮女人》：谁定义了女人？</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35143790/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35143790/"><span>《蛤蟆先生去看心理医生》</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/2209575/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/2209575/"><span>《少年时代》</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/1023557/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/1023557/"><span>《禁闭》</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>本期音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Cristobal Tapia de Veer - Aloha!</span></p><span></span><p><span>Dove Cameron - Sand</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>聊天的人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>梦妮</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿青</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于节目</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>一档又卷又菜又有心的闲聊节目。</span></p>]]></description>
